><span><span><span><span>人</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>应用心理（</span></span></span><span><span><span>045400，全日制专业学位）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>拟接收推荐免试入学硕士研究生人数：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>人。若推免人数不足，剩余名额转入统考招生人数，实际招生人数以最终确认录取人数为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>“少数民族骨干计划”或“退役大学生士兵专项计划”推免生指标单列。</span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>研究方向</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>拟招收推免数</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><strong><span><span><span><span>030100</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>法学</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>01 法学理论</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><strong><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>02 环境与资源保护法学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>03 林业与草原法治</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>04 民商法学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>05 刑法学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span><span><span>040200</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>心理学</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>01 临床与咨询心理学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>02 发展与教育心理学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>03 生态与文化心理学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span><span><span>045400</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>应用心理</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>（全日制专业学位）</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>01 临床与咨询心理学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>02 儿童发展与</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>心理健康</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>03管理心理学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>三、申请程序</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1、预报名。我校免试入学硕士研究生报名使用“北京林业大学推免生预报名系统”。教育部推免服务系统开通前，凡申请免试攻读我院20</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>26</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年全日制硕士研究生（含支教生、</span></span></span><span><span><span>“少数民族骨干计划”和“退役大学生士兵计划”等）请在规定时间内</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>登录</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>我校预报名系统</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>http://tm.yzb.bjfu.edu.cn/），点击“报名注册”，进入“北京林业大学推免生预报名系统”，进行预报名。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>具体专业预报名时间为：法学：</span></span></span><span><span>9月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>-9月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>24点</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；心理学及应用心理学：</span></span></span><span><span>9月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>-9月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>12点</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2、通知复试。预报名成功后，请及时关注电话及邮箱，资格</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>审查</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>通过的考生接到复试通知后应尽快在系统中确认是否同意参加复试。在</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>“教育部推免服务系统”开通后</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>，请报考我院考生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>及时</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>登陆教育部</span></span></span><span><span><span>“推免服务系统”进行正式报名。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3、考生参加复试。复试形式为线下复试，具体复试安排请见下文第</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>五</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>条。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4、我校将在“教育部推免服务系统”中发放拟录取通知，推免生应在规定的时间内按要求接受并确认，否则视为自动放弃，具体时间另行通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>四、资格审查安排</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>我院将对考生在复试当天</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>进行</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>资格</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复查</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>各专业资格复查时间分别为</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（以下安排按照时间顺序排序）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>学科专业名称</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>资格审查时间</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>地点</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>心理学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>9月18日 </span></span><span></span><span><span>8：00</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学研大厦</span></span></span><span><span><span>C1132</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>应用心理</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>9月18日 </span></span><span></span><span><span>8：30</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学研大厦</span></span></span><span><span><span>C1132</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>法学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>9月18日 </span></span><span></span><span><span>12：30</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学研大厦</span></span></span><span><span><span>C1132</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span><span>查验材料及要求如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1、第二代身份证</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>原件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，学生证原件；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2、加盖学校教务处公章的本科成绩单</span></span></span><span><span><span>1份（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>原件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3、国家英语四、六级证书或成绩单、TOEFL或GRE成绩等体现</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考生本人</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>英语水平的证明</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1份</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考生简历及</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>其他证明申请人学术水平和业务能力的学术论文或获奖证书等材料</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复印件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试缴费证明：通过资格初审</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>需自行在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>我校</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>预推免系统中扫码缴费，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>缴费成功</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>后</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>打印</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>缴费成功</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>页面进行资格</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>查。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6、报考</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>我院心理学和应用心理专业的考生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>如有</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>心之森</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>优秀营员证</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>请提供</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>7、申请“少数民族骨干”或“退役大学生士兵”专项计划，还需收取相关材料，请关注邮箱通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>凡未进行资格</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>查或资格</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>查未通过的考生，一律不得参加复试。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>五、复试安排</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1、复试时间及</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>地点</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（以下安排按照时间顺序排序）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>学科专业名称</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>复试时间</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>复试</span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><span>地点</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>心理学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>9月18日 </span></span><span></span><span><span>8：30</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学研大厦</span></span></span><span><span><span>C1233</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>应用心理</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>9月18日 </span></span><span></span><span><span>9：00</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学研大厦</span></span></span><span><span><span>C1233</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>法学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>9月18日 </span></span><span></span><span><span>14：00</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学研大厦</span></span></span><span><span><span>C1233</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span><span>2、复试内容</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试内容主要包括外语听力及口语和综合素质面试两部分，主要考核考生的专业知识、科研潜能、心理健康、思想品德及人文素养等。学术型招生学科注重考查申请人对学科基础知识和基本技能掌握程度以及分析和解决问题的能力。专业学位类型或领域突出考查申请人的实践应用能力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>2）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试总成绩</span></span></span><span><span><span>=外语听力及口语测试+综合素质面试，其中外语听力及口语测试满分为100分，综合素质面试满分为100分。复试满分为200分，120分合格。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>3）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>综合素质面试考察标准：是否答问一致，态度鲜明；是否逻辑严密，表达清晰；是否具备综合研究能力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>4）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>心理学跨学科门类考生需加试两门拟接收相近专业的本科主干课程，考试时间每科</span></span></span><span><span><span>1小时，成绩按百分制计算。考试科目一：普通心理学，科目二：心理学研究方法。考试时间另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>六、体检</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>1、所有接收的推免生需进行体检，体检标准同《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2、所有接收的推免生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>请</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>自行选择二级甲等以上医院进行体检，体检表最晚应于</span></span></span><span><span><span>10月20日前上交</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>至学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3、体检表：研究生院下载中心自行下载，填写相关内容，体检全部结束后</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>将</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>体检表交</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>至学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>体检表邮寄地址：北京市海淀区北京林业大学学研大厦</span></span></span><span><span><span>C座1222室，收件人：苏老师，联系电话：010-62338383</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>七、录取</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>各学科专业按照招生计划，根据推免生复试总成绩排名及身体健康状况确定拟录取名单，并在报名系统中发放待录取通知</span></span></span><span><span><span>,最终录取名单以教育部审核通过的为准。有以下情况之一的不予录取：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1、复试成绩不及格；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2、体检不合格；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3、无导师接收；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4、其他不符合教育部录取条件者。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>八、其他</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>1、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请人在同等条件下，有以下情况者可优先录取：</span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span><span><span>条件</span></span></span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>法学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>本科阶段有公开发表的学术论文；在国家、省市以上大赛中获奖</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>心理学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span>本科阶段有公开发表的学术论文；在国家、省市以上大赛中获奖</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“心之森”夏令营</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>优秀</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>营员</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>应用</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>心理</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span><span>2、如申请人提供的材料不真实，一经发现即取消申请人录取资格，并通报其所在本科院校。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3、凡申请人在取得录取资格后出现以下情况者，学校将取消其录取资格：未获得就读学校推荐免试资格、提供的材料有弄虚作假现象、受到纪律处分、入学前未获得本科毕业证书或政审、体检不合格者。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4、北京林业大学推免生预报名系统仅为学校接收推免生的辅助系统，用于前期复试信息采集。在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>开通后，请考生务必登陆教育部</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>进行正式报名。再根据申请人的复试综合成绩，在教育部</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>向通过复试的推免生发送</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>待录取</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>通知，推免生须登陆系统点击确认</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>待录取</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>后，才能获得推荐免试拟录取资格，完成最终拟录取。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>我院法学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学术型</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>硕士研究生、心理学学术型硕士研究生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>接收的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>支教生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>人员原则上</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>各</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>不超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>1人，专业学位类型不限。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>人文社会科学学院网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>http://renwen.bjfu.edu.cn/；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>人文社会科学学院研究生招生咨询电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>010-62338383；电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>bjfu_rwyz@163.com</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>北京林业大学研究生院网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>http://graduate.bjfu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>投诉受理电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>010-62336079或62338214或62338380；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>传真</span></span></span><span><span><span>010-62337873；邮箱：yzb@bjfu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>北京林业大学人文社会科学学院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2025年9月11日</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2158ef38e79feea4e3a6ec423a1316b122584851a4e1febf4678a89ced9af801","textLength":2937,"sourceSha256":"1c0c79a6b088db90afd4f2eb2962815dd4092192e831adf361bd8b72fc6a07e9","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-97be704272450c8963e8","title":"2025年北京林业大学人文社会科学学院2026年接收推荐免试入学硕士研究生 复试办法及安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:43.370142+00:00"}
